     5	a conservative envelope for the complete component of the stated quantity.
     6	Raw pairs, a single fit and local-only diagnostics remain unadmitted. A declared
     7	CERTIFIED_BOUND additionally requires proof/roundoff checks. Evidence references
     8	remain inspectable authority inputs; a JSON label alone cannot establish them.
     9	
    10	The seven fixed allocations are inherited from docs/roadmap/ERROR_BUDGET.json.
    11	Profiles are different products, not aliases. Required errors combine by L1;
    12	no independence/RSS assumption or automatic paper/AOCC prerequisite is added.
    13	The required h-dt coupling is included once, either additively or within the
    14	spatial estimate. Missing error components are never silently assigned zero.
    15	
    16	JSON decimals are parsed as Decimal before any binary-float conversion. Budget
    17	arithmetic uses exact rationals of those input values (or decimal repr values
    18	for a caller supplying Python floats). A certified
    19	sum is returned as a numerator/denominator pair, not a rounded-down float. This
